    "title": "Drone in the sky leads Bernalillo County deputies to quick arrest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KOB ,\n10 hours ago\nBERNALILLO COUNTY, N.M. – Bernalillo County deputies released new video Wednesday showing the success of their drone program.\nDeputies say last month they got calls about a man trying to push a car into a ditch near Coors and Barcelona.\nThey say Oscar Marquez ran when they arrived, and even tried to get into a passerby’s truck, hanging onto the door handle until the driver stopped.\nDeputies used their drones to track Marquez. They had to tase him before they arrested him.\n1",
    "summary": "BERNALILLO COUNTY, N.M. – Bernalillo County deputies released new video Wednesday showing the success of their drone program. Deputies say last month they got calls about a man trying to push a car into a ditch near Coors and Barcelona. They say Oscar Marquez ran when they arrived, and even tried to get into a passerby’s truck, hanging onto the door handle until the driver stopped. Deputies used their drones to track Marquez. They had to tase him before they arrested him.",
